    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1716487017\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/36a3fbd53cc84104da12d013ac2d652f.avif?t=1716487017\" width=617 height=102 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/00d08874813843f6a245bf6af319a8bd.poster.avif?t=1716487017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/00d08874813843f6a245bf6af319a8bd.webm?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/00d08874813843f6a245bf6af319a8bd.mp4?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready for the ultimate soccer showdown in this fast-paced party game! Dive into the chaos of 2 vs 2 matches where pure skill reigns supreme. No items, no power-ups, just you, your teammate, and your wits against the unpredictable elements of each unique level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/9807b92d6490c8f1dc5e4a43f8a7c150.avif?t=1716487017\" width=617 height=102 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/1ef1890215007bd33cd847567a48bf11.poster.avif?t=1716487017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/1ef1890215007bd33cd847567a48bf11.webm?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/1ef1890215007bd33cd847567a48bf11.mp4?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Chaotic Environments:</strong> Navigate through a variety of levels filled with obstacles and unique mechanics that will keep you on your toes. It's not just about outplaying your opponents; it's about mastering the environment itself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/02b1e9299b501c1758287ccddc9ddc7a.poster.avif?t=1716487017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/02b1e9299b501c1758287ccddc9ddc7a.webm?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/02b1e9299b501c1758287ccddc9ddc7a.mp4?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Pure Skill Gameplay:</strong> No gimmicks here. Soccer Party is all about showcasing your soccer prowess. Run, dash, kick, and jump your way to victory with precise controls and lightning-fast reflexes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/6f50481d9c86e42e4e7631f154e6c662.poster.avif?t=1716487017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/6f50481d9c86e42e4e7631f154e6c662.webm?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/6f50481d9c86e42e4e7631f154e6c662.mp4?t=1716487017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Local Co-op and Versus Modes:</strong> Grab a friend and team up for cooperative play or go head-to-head in versus mode. Challenge the CPU if you're feeling especially competitive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902670/extras/02737cea0d080d9d5ab86cdeee2b8ae3.avif?t=1716487017\" width=617 height=102 /></span><br><br>Whether you're a seasoned soccer pro or just looking for some chaotic fun with friends, Soccer Party offers something for everyone. Gather your squad, lace up your cleats, and get ready to kick it in the craziest soccer party ever!",
